Qpc5mHHDvsYQ7kNvwGe5LLe&_nc_oc=Adq5lWfxvHjd0mGGILDZ-_gcJXYtcsDkd8hCovY8nO1WlGWsYGVKKC3OWNEBUPAYQvY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCGXHLiVkSF4nISUZ7e28GB27BFkVmW5HYcLST9Vdx0ZQ&oe=6A68B937"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PKFz97bfOcYQ7kNvwHMeXB2&_nc_oc=Adq-vuBtWU7y6hpHBITtiD3ZP19-vm_Ol8-oQJdj5pdY7rljauqKVpPG9zcCmi6zpUk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAozpotx2sY7Yua0K0VAIEE2GwYJIoJmhVYPI153Rrutw&oe=6A68BACA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z41bSGAWukcQ7kNvwESOJfY&_nc_oc=Adojiv860Ga51Z57Cd22uv2596bi-75SNEuDzntkS0oWZqTPtVjb9NUiED-qu12B99c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBSqJdToYib8DzSL1jCRazZkBP9Bmt4G1hL3XBzbFVwGQ&oe=6A68A7EF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=74rZAj-zyzEQ7kNvwHcrxKW&_nc_oc=AdqR7z_vB-paf7B9fekwPElTLTIOuCKE5ecFP379qFrlLYmYJapCEYOyECliDaodQvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCdNLgyxjdNSb7k3bYByc_sAc1Wqt_abY-GCnlQa_ifiA&oe=6A689143"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=A1W6c0U0SrUQ7kNvwGX54Gc&_nc_oc=Adrth0rIXrRkORIMAYNGDTujAR-ew1_Nyuvwx2-3sEucJc2YA2zbVu8brJtz5fBBqGw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCXQaCPGhBapKCZl-nvnMqjYhLG3-5AdYPDKovAau2rrw&oe=6A68C1D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ehcuTbaQx9QQ7kNvwHFYj0U&_nc_oc=Adp6NyxBPLMOamUESWO-ghrKPcDz6xIaP4c2r9an2KqN-QCByLvopzbjv0CrmRxBQY4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCvCJKrsn-YtExkXjdrICZ2S3cyTl4JqHS19Re5FaGIgQ&oe=6A689CBC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080